Scope
=====

The MIT license below covers the source code in this repository: everything
under `src/`, and the root-level `run_full_pipeline.py`, `test_assertions.py`
and `requirements.txt`.

It does not cover the following, and nothing in it should be read as granting
rights over them.

`data/` and `results/`
    The split, site and frame index files, the per-run metrics and per-frame
    accuracies, and the result tables derive from the AI Hub Precision
    Agriculture Farm Machinery Autonomous Driving dataset
    (https://aihub.or.kr/aihubdata/data/view.do?dataSetSn=526). The AI Hub
    usage policy (https://www.aihub.or.kr/intrcn/guid/usagepolicy.do) states
    that the data AI Hub provides were constructed as part of the Intelligent
    Information Industry Infrastructure Development project of the Korean
    Ministry of Science and ICT and the National Information Society Agency
    (NIA). Their use is governed by that policy, not by this license. They are
    published here so that the results reported in the accompanying paper can
    be checked, and any reuse states that the data are a result of NIA's
    project, as that policy requires of derivative works.

`paper/ieeeconf.cls`
    The IEEE conference class, a revision of IEEEtran.cls. Its header names its
    copyright holders and states that it is distributed under the Perl
    Artistic License.

The rest of `paper/`, and the README
    The manuscript, its bibliography, its generated tables and figure, and the
    README.
    Copyright (c) 2026 Anonymous Authors. All rights reserved.


